odot/pull/105916.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-30T21:54:57Z"},"body":"Currently, MSVC crash/assert macros aren't guaranteed to abort the program. This is because the builtin function called by `GENERATE_TRAP()`, `__debugbreak()`, only served as a breakpoint for compilers. It's now been replaced by `__fastfail()`, which mirrors the functionality of `__builtin_trap()` by also aborting the program. This required adding `intrin.h` as a header for MSVC builds, because I guess Microsoft likes not having all of its builtins builtin","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105916/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105916/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}